thing to say, and the franc's comeback condition from Tuesday is still met.|Oil kept sliding, and that is the side of the story that matters for this cross today.|Cheaper oil and a silent Tokyo kept both legs right where they were.|The franc's trigger sits on the table; this tie waits for Friday to decide if it counts.|A haven duel where the weaker haven's rescue condition was met on Tuesday and has not been cancelled.|Gold slipped under $3,800 today, yet its gap is decided by inputs, and none of them changed.")
